Conclusion
  CH is important here because it is the archetype of a quotient being
  too weak: the scalar cardinal 2^aleph_0 does not determine the universe
  of reals without a model/generic side channel.  The repo analogue is to
  stop treating counts, residues, H-values, or wall scalars as complete
  proof objects until the predicate-preserving fiber is named.
